1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,680
 and troubles of the world.

2
00:00:02,680 --> 00:00:07,320
 Once I was a mission leader, I received a new missionary.

3
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,600
 And I welcome interview this young missionary

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,840
 began to cry and asked to be sent home.

5
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:18,160
 When I asked why, he couldn't find the right world

6
00:00:18,160 --> 00:00:20,400
 to explain.

7
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:24,080
 Then I asked him, if he had the testimony of Book of Mormon,

8
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:27,560
 he said, "President, I don't."

9
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:30,200
 I bought my testimony book of Mormon.

10
00:00:30,200 --> 00:00:33,360
 I then encourage him to begin to study the scriptures,

11
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:35,440
 especially the book of Mormon.

12
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:40,440
 He and his trainer made the scripture study plan later.

13
00:00:41,480 --> 00:00:45,280
 I received a letter from this missionary testifying

14
00:00:45,280 --> 00:00:48,880
 of how their scripture study had helped him

15
00:00:48,880 --> 00:00:51,520
 understand his purpose as a missionary.

16
00:00:51,520 --> 00:00:55,240
 He said, and I quote, "I am happy now,

17
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:58,840
 And do not want to be sent to Him any longer.

18
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:02,000
 My friends, I invite you to send the scripture

19
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
 Give it a gentle.

